meta {
  name: Knowledge Base
  seq: 17
}

docs {
  The workspace knowledge base agents retrieve from — ingested text and
  files, plus synced sources (web pages and connected apps). Members can
  also keep private knowledge (`private`), seen only by them and their
  assistant.

  Variables: `Knowledge Base - Ingest` stores `knowledgeChunkId`;
  `Knowledge Sources - Create` stores `knowledgeSourceId`.
}
